    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i've been having this really annoying gnawing pain in my upper stomach for a few weeks now. i think it's just bad indigestion or something so i've been taking omeprazole every morning. but i just got a really bad toothache from a cavity and i really need some pain relief. is it okay if i take some ibuprofen for the toothache? i don't want to mess up my stomach more but the pain is killing me.",
