    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but i really cant get to a doctor right now and it's late. i've been taking the omeprazole for a bit now and it seems to be working okay for the stomach stuff. won't the omeprazole basically protect my stomach lining if i just take a couple of advil for the tooth? i just need to get through the night.",
